{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00769","headline":"舞曲歌辞 凯乐歌辞 应圣期 · 不详","name":"舞曲歌辞 凯乐歌辞 应圣期","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣德期昌运，雍熙万宇清。\n乾坤资化育，海岳共休明。\n辟土欣耕稼，销戈遂偃兵。\n殊方歌帝泽，执贽贺昇平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00769.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00769","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}